(Real usage is never exactly the average: some days nobody buys the item, some days two people do. The) Tj
T* (Poisson distribution is the standard model for counting independent events per day \(customers, calls, sales\). It) Tj
T* (turns the expected value into a realistic whole number: often 0, sometimes 1, rarely 3 or more. A day with 0 gets) Tj
T* (no record.) Tj
